---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { interests, alsoInterested, papers, courses, languages, TRANSCRIPT } from '../data/site';
const b = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<Base title="CV" description="Curriculum vitae of Emre Ertürk.">
<div class="wrap cv">
<header><h1>Emre Ertürk</h1><p class="ct"><span>emreerturk@std.iyte.edu.tr</span><span>emreerturk4585@gmail.com</span><span>github.com/EmreErturk-3</span><span>emreerturk-3.github.io</span></p></header>

<h2>Research interests</h2><p>{interests.join(', ')}. Also: {alsoInterested.toLowerCase()}.</p>

<h2>Education</h2>
<div class="r"><b>B.Sc. in Computer Engineering, <a href="https://en.iyte.edu.tr/">İzmir Institute of Technology</a></b><span>2022–present</span></div>
<p>Planning graduate study in robotics at Middle East Technical University (METU).</p>
<p>CGPA 3.12 (fall 2025–26 term: 3.83). YDS 93.5 (English, C1). ALES 85. <a href={`${b}${TRANSCRIPT}`}>Transcript (PDF)</a>.</p>
<p><b>Relevant coursework:</b> {courses.relevant.map(([c, n, g]) => `${n} (${g})`).join(', ')}. <b>This term:</b> {courses.current.map(([c, n]) => n).join(', ')}.</p>
<p>Senior thesis: Smart Zebra (with Onur Kansoy, equal contribution), advised by Assoc. Prof. Selma Tekir, funded by TÜBİTAK 2209-A.</p>

<div class="r"><b>İzmir Atatürk Lisesi, İzmir</b><span>High school</span></div><p>Member of IALHUK, the school aviation club.</p>

<h2>Papers and reports</h2>
{papers.map((p) => <p class="pub"><span set:html={p.authors} />. <b>{p.title}</b>. <i>{p.venue}</i></p>)}

<h2>Research projects</h2>
<div class="r"><b><a href={`${b}/research/evomaxx/`}>EvoMaxx v10</a>: an evolving artificial chemistry</b><span>2026, ongoing</span></div><p>GPU artificial-life system (WebGL2) in which an eight-gene regulatory network drives three chemicals. Mapped a 24,480-rule space with controlled experiments on about 18,000 worlds (exact McNemar tests on held-out genomes); raised the share of lifelike genomes from 7% to 95%. Reproduced twelve A-life papers (Lenia, Flow-Lenia, Physarum, MAP-Elites and others).</p>
<div class="r"><b><a href={`${b}/research/slavemaker/`}>Slavemaker Swarm</a>: individual-based model of dulosis</b><span>2026</span></div><p>3-D agent-based simulation of Polyergus raids with five pheromone fields, an enslavement pipeline, queen usurpation, slave rebellion and colony-level coevolution. Calibrated against field observations of raid cadence.</p>
<div class="r"><b><a href={`${b}/research/aeass/`}>AEASS v3</a>: memetic algorithm for constraint satisfaction</b><span>2025; revised fall 2026</span></div><p>GA with Lamarckian min-conflicts local search and ILS escapes on logic-reduced domains, in Python, C99 and WebGL2. 65,201 of 65,201 verified runs solved over 52,458 benchmark puzzles; audit of an invalid earlier version; full ablation.</p>
<h2>Ongoing</h2><p><a href={`${b}/research/#reproductions`}>Reproductions in evolutionary computation and swarm robotics</a>: BEECLUST aggregation with simulated Kilobots in ARGoS, the Vicsek ordering transition, NEAT on XOR, Gray–Scott patterns.</p>

<h2>Robotics</h2>
<div class="r"><b><a href={`${b}/robotics/#pcb`}>P.C.B indoor delivery robot</a>, CENG 483</b><span>Spring 2026</span></div><p>Team of four. Arduino Mega and Jetson Nano; IMU-aided PID heading control with gyro- and motor-bias calibration; reactive ultrasonic navigation; ArUco landmarks; three prototypes.</p>
<div class="r"><b><a href={`${b}/robotics/#partybot`}>PartyBot</a>, CENG 424 Embedded Computer Systems</b><span>Spring 2026</span></div><p>Team of four. Gesture-controlled mecanum robot; two ESP32 boards over ESP-NOW.</p>

<h2>Skills</h2><p><b>Languages:</b> Python, C, JavaScript/TypeScript, GLSL. <b>Simulation and graphics:</b> WebGL2, GPU compute, agent-based modelling, ARGoS. <b>Robotics:</b> Arduino, Jetson Nano, ESP32, OpenCV. <b>Methods:</b> evolutionary algorithms, local search, experimental design and statistical testing.</p>
<h2>Languages</h2><p>{languages.map(([l, d]) => `${l} (${d})`).join('; ')}.</p>
</div>
</Base>
<style is:global>.cv{max-width:860px;padding-block:44px}.cv h1{font-size:clamp(38px,6vw,56px)}.cv header{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;align-items:flex-start}.cv h2{font-size:20px;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:26px 0 6px;padding-bottom:4px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--wall)}.cv .r{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:2px 18px;margin-top:8px;align-items:baseline}.cv .r span{font:12.5px var(--mono);color:var(--mut);white-space:nowrap;text-align:right}.cv p{font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.5}.cv .pub{margin-top:6px}.cv .pub i{color:var(--mut)}.cv .todo{margin-top:8px}
.cv .ct span:not(:last-child)::after{content:" · "}
@media screen and (max-width:700px){.cv .ct span{display:block;line-height:1.7}.cv .ct span::after{content:none!important}.cv .r{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.cv .r span{text-align:left;white-space:normal}}
@media print{.nav,.foot,.noprint{display:none!important}body{background:#fff;color:#111;font-size:12px}.cv{padding:0;max-width:none}.cv h2{margin-top:12px;font-size:14px;break-after:avoid}.cv p{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.38}.cv h1{font-size:28px}}</style>
